From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: timvdhoorn <timvdhoorn@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 19:11:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 8/9] feat(server): keep idle compactions silent

Upstream's idle compaction (#21682) sends /compact as a visible turn, which can push an alert or Live Activity and mark a read thread unread. The relay and direct push now skip a thread whose latest run is an idle compaction (settling and archiving still publish), and a finished compaction moves the read mark only when the thread was already read.
